+# Taskboard CLI
+
+Dependency-free task manager for Bun. The database is `.taskboard.json` in the current directory, or the path in `TASKBOARD_FILE`.
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Ship release" --tags work,release --due 2026-12-31
+bun run src/cli.ts list --status open
+bun run src/cli.ts done 1
+bun run src/cli.ts stats
+bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
+```
+
+Every invocation emits one JSON value to stdout; errors are written to stderr and return a non-zero exit code.
