+# Taskboard CLI
+
+A dependency-free TypeScript task manager for Bun. Data is stored in
+`.taskboard.json` in the current directory, or in the path specified by
+`TASKBOARD_FILE`.
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Ship release" --tags work,important --due 2099-12-31
+bun run src/cli.ts list --status open
+bun run src/cli.ts done 1
+bun run src/cli.ts stats
+bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
+```
+
+Each invocation emits one JSON value on stdout. Errors emit a JSON error and a
+diagnostic on stderr, then exit non-zero. Writes use a temporary sibling file
+and rename for atomic persistence.
