+# Taskboard CLI
+
+A dependency-free task manager for Bun. Data is stored in `.taskboard.json` in
+the current directory, or at the path in `TASKBOARD_FILE`.
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts add --title "Ship release" --tags work,release --due 2026-12-31
+bun run src/cli.ts list --status open
+bun run src/cli.ts done 1
+bun run src/cli.ts stats
+bun run src/cli.ts delete 1
+```
+
+Each invocation writes one JSON value to stdout. Errors are also described on
